# Requiem of Sin (battlefield.requiem_of_sin, Boneyard Gully): The entry menu (event 32000, params 0,0,0,64): option 0
# releases only, option 4 answers update 5, option 97 (index 6, area 1) answers update (2,6,0,1800) with the messages
# 7771, 7610, 7384 and 7387. Finish, tick 2000, kill SHIKAREE_Z_ROS, SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT and SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT, then a
# trigger of the armoury crate +84 (its loot to main's inventory: three items), six ticks of 2000: event 32001
# (1,1800,0,37,8,6). The finish changes nothing: the quest's 32001 (OtherAreas/RequiemOfSin.cs) completes it only when
# accepted with battlefieldWin set to the battlefield, and no char here has the quest accepted (the quest flows prove
# the completion). Then ticks 11000 and 10000.
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem LetterFromShikareeY
login
trigger _081
update 32000 option=0
update 32000 option=4
update 32000 option=97
finish
tick 2000
kill SHIKAREE_Z_ROS
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT
trigger Armoury_Crate+84
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
